<Base title="Corrections" description="Known conflicts that are shown on the pages instead of being silently corrected." crumbs={[{ name: "Home", href: "/" }, { name: "Corrections", href: "/corrections/" }]}>
  <h1>Corrections</h1>
  <p>Checked 2026-11-14. These are not quiet edits. The pages still show the disagreement.</p>
  <h2>Added 2026-11-15 from the gap documents</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Massey Ferguson GC1723E and GC1723EB PTO: the earlier US brochure cell is 18.7 hp (13.9 kW). The May 2023 US brochure prints 18.3 hp (13.6 kW). Both stay on the page.</li>
    <li>Case IH Farmall 50A engine: the August 2026 spec sheet prints 52 hp. The product-page card prints 50. PTO figures on those two sources match.</li>
    <li>New Holland Workmaster 40 and Boomer 40 engine: the March 2025 brochure prints 40 hp with 29.2 kW. Those two numbers do not convert. The Boomer page also prints 40 (29.8 kW) in another cell.</li>
    <li>New Holland Boomer 45, 50, and 55 loader: the brochure prints 2,371 lb with 1,876 kg at the bucket pivot pin. Those units do not convert. The 500 mm figure, 1,849 lb (839 kg), does.</li>
    <li>LS MT225E and MT225HE engine: the specifications table prints 24.6 gross hp and the cover bullet prints 24.7.</li>
    <li>LS MT573CPS transmission: the specifications table says synchro shuttle and a feature callout says power shuttle.</li>
    <li>Kioti DK20 SE fuel tank: the September 2026 sheet prints 12.7 gal (39.6 L). Those units do not convert.</li>
    <li>TYM T454, T494, and T494C fuel: the pages print 17.0 gal with 60 L. 17.0 US gallons is not 60 liters.</li>
    <li>TYM T264 crankcase: the 2024 brochure prints 4.5 qt (4.3 L) and the operator manual prints 1.14 US gal. Transmission quantity is 4.7 gal (17.8 L) in the brochure and 5.81 US gal in the manual.</li>
  </ul>
  <ul>
    <li>Kubota L2502: the 2023 spec sheet and the 2026 full-line book print different gross and PTO horsepower. The 24-inch lift matches. See the L2502 page.</li>
    <li>John Deere 4066M and 4066R gear PTO: the literature prints 58 (53.2). The kilowatt figure does not match the horsepower figure. Hydrostatic figures on those models are published separately.</li>
    <li>Kioti CS2510H lift: the product page prints 700 lb (318 kg) and 318 lb (700 kg). No single lift number is published.</li>
    <li>John Deere 1025R fuel filter: the 2019 filter overview lists M801101 and the 2024 parts guide lists MIU804763 for later serials.</li>
    <li>Mahindra 1600 lift: the brochure prints 2,646 lb without a measurement point. A series web page has used 1,720 lb. The model pages use the brochure number and say the point was not stated.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>Send a document citation to the contact address if a cell should change. The change is logged here with a date.</p>
</Base>
